Hi guys,

I'm getting to my to-do list from Friday and was looking at what Hancock's got going in this area. I found this:

https://regionalcte.org/browse/ZbMkr

3 things to note:

  1.  It looks like Hancock just submitted this to the South Central Coast Regional Consortia last week.
  2.  I see a Criminal Investigation course on their elective list. Interesting. Perhaps another collaboration opportunity here at Cuesta? We have a Criminal Justice dept in the Skilled Trades division.
  3.  Check out the LMI - particularly the SLO section. Maybe you've already seen all of that?

Best,
Amy

